      "cooked": "<p>I have done following<br>\nbench init frappe-bench<br>\ncd frappe-bench<br>\nbench new-site <a href=\"http://iliyas.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">iliyas.com</a><br>\nbench get-app erpnext<br>\nbench get-app healthcare<br>\nbench use <a href=\"http://iliyas.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">iliyas.com</a><br>\nbench build<br>\nbench start</p>\n<p>I have to achieve as in second image, but healthcare is separate from erpnext as shown in first image. Please guide me how to achieve this.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/0/507074e66d82da06348eee1dfa71fdc550d835d9.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/507074e66d82da06348eee1dfa71fdc550d835d9\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/507074e66d82da06348eee1dfa71fdc550d835d9_2_690x290.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"btB8mtfjINfWg5ii3JGdlyPaXzj\" width=\"690\" height=\"290\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/507074e66d82da06348eee1dfa71fdc550d835d9_2_690x290.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/507074e66d82da06348eee1dfa71fdc550d835d9_2_1035x435.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/0/507074e66d82da06348eee1dfa71fdc550d835d9_2_1380x580.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1909×803 72.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/a/aa148dc3a312ac80c5e886f24631f20b68bd62a5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.